							<h5 class="sub-title">Who We Are</h5>
							<h2>An Independent Charity Organization</h2>
							<p class="m-t20">Utthan Foundation is an NGO focused on empowering the vulnerable, including orphans, elderly, and mentally ill persons. We strive to build a stronger community through our various programs and initiatives. Join us in making a positive impact in the world </p>
						</div>
						<div class="icon-bx-wraper box-hover style-2 m-b30">
							<div class="icon-lg"> 
								<a href="/about-us" class="icon-cell">
									<i class="flaticon-shield"></i>
								</a> 
							</div>
							<div class="icon-content">
							<h5 class="dz-tilte m-b5 text-capitalize">Trusted Partner</h5>
								<p>The foundation has a proven track record of success and has made a meaningful difference in the communities it serves. </p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="icon-bx-wraper box-hover style-2 m-b30">
							<div class="icon-lg"> 
								<a href="/about-us" class="icon-cell">
									<i class="flaticon-shield"></i>
								</a> 
							</div>
							<div class="icon-content">
								<h5 class="dz-tilte m-b5 text-capitalize">Responsibility</h5>
								<p>The individual has personal connections or experience with the foundation and has seen the positive impact it has had firsthand. </p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="col-lg-5 m-b30">
						<div class="dz-media">
							<img src="/images/main-slider/about.jpg" alt="image">
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		
		
		<!-- About Us -->
		<section class="content-inner-2 overlay-primary-dark about-wrapper2 bg-img-fix" style="background-image:url('/images/background/bg4.jpg');  background-size: cover; background-repeat: no-repeat;">
			<div class="container">
				<%- include('partials/flash') %>

				<% if (typeof currentUser !== 'undefined' && currentUser && currentUser.role === 'admin') { %>
					<div class="mb-3">
						<button
							type="button"
							class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm"
							data-bs-toggle="modal"
							data-bs-target="#modalEditChairmanAbout"
						>
							<i class="fa-solid fa-pen me-2"></i>Edit Chairman Section
						</button>
					</div>
				<% } %>

				<% if (typeof chairman !== 'undefined' && chairman) { %>
					<div class="about-bx2">
						<div class="row g-0">
							<div class="col-lg-4">
								<div class="dz-media">
									<img src="<%= chairman.photoPath %>" alt="<%= chairman.name %>">
								</div>
							</div>
							<div class="col-lg-8">
								<div class="dz-info">
									<h2 class="title m-b30 m-md-b20">Message From Chairman</h2>
									<p class="text" style="text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;"><%= chairman.message %></p>
									<div class="signature">
										<% if (chairman.signaturePath) { %>
											<img src="<%= chairman.signaturePath %>" alt="signature">
										<% } %>
										<p class="text-dark m-t15 mb-0">
											<strong><%= chairman.name %></strong>
											<% if (chairman.role) { %>
												<br>{<%= chairman.role %>}
											<% } %>
										</p>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				<% } else { %>
					<div class="text-center text-white py-5">
						<p class="mb-0">Chairman section is not set yet.</p>
					</div>
				<% } %>
			</div>
		</section>
		<!-- About Us -->
		
		<!-- icon -box -->
		<section class="content-inner"> 
			<div class="container">
				<div class="section-head text-center">
					<h5 class="sub-title">CATEGORIES</h5>
					<h2 class="m-b20">Why choose Utthan Foundation</h2>
					<p>The foundation's focus on uplifting underprivileged communities through education, healthcare, and livelihood development programs aligns with the individual's values and desire to make a positive impact in these areas.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="row">
					<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
						<div class="icon-bx-wraper box-hover style-2 m-b30">
							<div class="icon-lg"> 
								<a href="/about-us" class="icon-cell">
									<i class="flaticon-vr-glasses"></i>
								</a> 
							</div>
							<div class="icon-content">
								<h5 class="dz-tilte m-b10 text-capitalize">Rescuing Animals</h5>
								<p>We are ever ready for rescuing animals just call us on our helpline and we'll be there </p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
						<div class="icon-bx-wraper box-hover style-2 m-b30">
							<div class="icon-lg"> 
								<a href="/about-us" class="icon-cell">
									<i class="flaticon-transformation"></i>
								</a> 
							</div>
							<div class="icon-content">
								<h5 class="dz-tilte m-b10 text-capitalize">Charity</h5>
								<p>We Provide all the necessities to the pople in need and we are 24/7 available for them. </p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
						<div class="icon-bx-wraper box-hover style-2 m-b30">
							<div class="icon-lg"> 
								<a href="/about-us" class="icon-cell">
									<i class="flaticon-doctor-bag"></i>
								</a> 
							</div>
							<div class="icon-content">
								<h5 class="dz-tilte m-b10 text-capitalize">Medical Facilities</h5>
								<p>We Provide Medical Facilities to the people in need and we are 24/7 available for them. </p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
						<div class="icon-bx-wraper box-hover style-2 m-b30">
							<div class="icon-lg"> 
								<a href="/about-us" class="icon-cell">
									<i class="flaticon-open-book"></i>
								</a> 
							</div>
							<div class="icon-content">
								<h5 class="dz-tilte m-b10 text-capitalize">Providing Education</h5>
								<p>Providing access of education to the underprivileged children who are in need. </p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<!-- icon -box -->
		 
		














	
		
